{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slide":1,"text":"Good morning. I am Aryan. I am interested in building digital products. I enjoy taking a rough idea and turning it into something useful. I chose the words ‘idea to product’ because they describe how I like to work. In this presentation, I will explain the kind of problems I enjoy, how I work, the skills I am building, and one project that shows my direction."}
