{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xgfil8zy","slide":2,"name":"Thinking Caption","text":"I enjoy work that starts unclear\nand ends useful.","textPreview":"I enjoy work that starts unclear | and ends useful.","textChars":49,"textLines":2,"bbox":[120,855,700,90]}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/fa50vexk","slide":2,"name":"","bbox":[255,420,430,430]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slide":2,"text":"I enjoy work that does not have a clear answer at the start. First, I try to understand the real problem. Then I divide the work into smaller steps. I build a simple version, see what works, and improve it. This is why product thinking and web development interest me. They allow me to move from an idea to something a person can actually use."}
