{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ofy9wn61","slide":3,"text":"Three behaviours guide my work. The first is curiosity. I ask why before choosing a solution. The second is clarity. I try to explain ideas in simple words so the team can move together. The third is ownership. When I accept a task, I stay with it until the result works. These behaviours are the character I want people to connect with my name."}
