{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jyx0ra1s","slide":4,"text":"My main strength is the combination of thinking and building. I try to understand what the user needs before deciding what to create. I can then turn the idea into a working web product. Research and testing help me improve the result. I also use AI tools as support, while keeping the final decisions clear and human. This combination helps me contribute from the early idea stage to the working solution."}
