{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i107q5of","slide":5,"text":"Scripted Fox is evidence of this direction. It is a digital product for YouTube creators. Many creators have an idea but still struggle to shape it into a clear video. The product is designed to make the path from an idea to a ready script simpler. Working on it required product thinking, interface design and web development. It taught me that useful products begin with a clear user problem and improve through repeated testing."}
