{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8f69ofe","slide":6,"text":"The professional identity I am building is simple. I want people to see me as someone who can take an unclear idea and make it useful. I am still learning, so my brand is not based on claiming that I know everything. It is based on curiosity, steady improvement and taking responsibility for my work. My final brand statement is: I am Aryan, an aspiring product builder who turns unclear ideas into simple digital tools."}